        </li>
        <li>
          <h2><a href="https://www.smartlab.gov.hk/en/ai_solutions/a-0077" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smart LAB A-0077</a></h2>
          <p>Tencent Cloud Digital Human listing.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2><a href="https://ddiy.hkpc.org/en/node/1519" rel="noopener noreferrer">HKPC Digital DIY · DYXnet</a></h2>
          <p>Hong Kong Productivity Council catalogue entry, with a <a href="https://www.dyxnet.com/hk/digital-human-platform/" rel="noopener noreferrer">product page</a>.</p>
